{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19928","headline":"招文士饮 · 孟郊","name":"招文士饮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曹刘不免死，谁敢负年华。\n文士莫辞酒，诗人命属花。\n退之如放逐，李白自矜夸。\n万古忽将似，一朝同叹嗟。\n何言天道正，独使地形斜。\n南士愁多病，北人悲去家。\n梅芳已流管，柳色未藏鸦。\n相劝罢吟雪，相从愁饮霞。\n醒时不可过，愁海浩无涯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19928.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19928","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}